{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Topology.Order.IntermediateValue","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.AdjointIndexSetM3"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.floor_remainders_from_derived_fields","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.floor_remainders_from_derived_fields","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L149-L154","doc":"The remainders `0` and `1`, and their unit difference (Part 1's forced value),\nnow with the derived real-root counts as their source. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwo_realEmbeddings_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwo_realEmbeddings_derived","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L145-L147","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOne_realEmbeddings_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOne_realEmbeddings_derived","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L141-L143","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_existsUnique_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_existsUnique_root","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L127-L130","doc":"**Exactly one real root.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_root_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_root_unique","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L112-L125","doc":"**Uniqueness**: two real roots coincide. Both lie below `−1`, where the\ncubic is strictly increasing: `f(a) − f(b) = (a − b)(a² + ab + b² − 1)` and\n`a² + ab + b² − 1 > 0` there. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_root_lt_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_root_lt_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L106-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_pos_of_neg_one_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_pos_of_neg_one_le","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L93-L104","doc":"**Every real root lies below `−1`.** On `[−1, ∞)` the cubic is positive: for\n`θ ≥ 1` and for `θ ∈ [−1, 0]` the term `θ(θ² − 1)` is `≥ 0`; on `(0, 1)` it is\nbounded below by `−2/(3√3) > −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_exists_root","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_exists_root","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L83-L91","doc":"**Existence**: a real root in `(−2, −1)`, by the intermediate value theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L80-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_neg_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_neg_two","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L77-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_continuous","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic_continuous","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L74-L75","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fiveTwoShapeCubic","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L71-L72","doc":"The derived shape cubic of `5₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L66-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly_pos","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L62-L64","doc":"**No real root**: `x² − x + 1 = (x − ½)² + ¾ > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.fourOneShapePoly","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FloorRemainderFromDerivedShapeFields.lean#L59-L60","doc":"The minimal polynomial of the `4₁` shape `e^{iπ/3}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}